# Normalize line endings so the Prettier `format:check` gate is deterministic on
# every platform.
#
# Without this file, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` materializes
# CRLF working-tree files while Prettier's `endOfLine` is `lf`. `npm run check`
# then fails on *every* file in `src/` regardless of its actual formatting,
# which makes the mandatory verification gate impossible to satisfy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
